(14, 1, 'Lavender Retreat', '•	A dreamy setup with soft lavender and deep purple balloons for a magical touch.\r\n•	Stunning butterfly-themed cake stand and decor for a fairytale vibe.\r\n•	Private space accommodates up to 8 guests\r\n•	Backdrop neon lights adapt to your occasion\'s theme\r\n•	Sophisticated ambiance\r\n•	Premium amenities: cake stand, customized LED name board\r\n•	Projection screen & pre-installed OTT apps for an immersive entertainment experience.\r\n•	Immersive ambiance with fog effects, creating a dreamy atmosphere.\r\n', NULL, 1, 1500, 2, 10, 1, 300, '2026-09-01', '2099-12-31', '[\"gallery/Hulimavu/3/2.jpg\", \"gallery/Hulimavu/3/1.jpg\"]'),
(15, 1, 'Cinematic Royalty', '•	Luxurious blue and gold balloon décor for a grand and elegant vibe.\r\n•	A magical fog effect with glowing lights creates a dreamy atmosphere.\r\n•	Backdrop neon lights adapt to your occasion\'s theme\r\n•	Cozy private lounge seating for up to 30 guests, ensuring a comfortable celebration.\r\n•	Premium amenities: cake stand, customized LED name board\r\n•	Cinematic experience with a projection screen and pre-installed OTT apps.\r\n•	Premium gold-themed decor, including lanterns and a carousel centerpiece for a regal touch.\r\n•	Perfect for birthdays, milestone celebrations, and exclusive gatherings!\r\n', NULL, 1, 1500, 2, 30, 1, 300, '2026-09-01', '2099-12-31', '[\"gallery/Hulimavu/4/1.jpg\", \"gallery/Hulimavu/4/2.jpg\"]'),
(16, 1, 'Red Love', '•	Experience ultimate romantic ambiance\r\n•	6ft heart-shaped décor\r\n•	Adorned with vibrant red balloons\r\n•	Customizable neon lights backdrop\r\n•	Private space for special occasions\r\n•	Caters to birthdays, anniversaries, and more\r\n•	Luxurious sofa seating\r\n•	Premium amenities: cake stand, customized LED name board\r\n•	Perfect for couples and small groups\r\n•	Unforgettable, exclusive celebration\r\n', NULL, 1, 1500, 2, 8, 1, 300, '2026-09-01', '2099-12-31', '[\"gallery/Hulimavu/1/1.jpg\", \"gallery/Hulimavu/1/2.jpg\", \"gallery/Hulimavu/1/1.gif\"]');
